The csq-socks release archives bundle two csqtt clients by amurcanov
(csqtt is developed at https://github.com/Afteroid/csqttr):

  client-2.1.9  amurcanov's 2.1.9 client, unchanged.
  client-2.5.2  the csqtt 2.5 client from Afteroid/csqttr main (commit 84187d6, which carries our
                upload speed fix, Afteroid/csqttr#1) plus SanityProtocol's 2.5.2 client changes,
                source/client-2.5.2.patch: battery fixes for an idle tunnel, a downlink wake fix and
                their review fixes (offered upstream as Afteroid/csqttr#5).
  On Windows: client-2.1.9.exe and client-2.5.2.exe, the same two sources built for Windows.

